.TH cufilter n 0.1 ctrlutils
.SH ctrlutils::cufilter
.PP
A controller that provides a live filter box for a \fBtkufilelist\fR. As the user types, the list shows only matching files; directories always stay, so navigation still works while a filter is active.
.SS API
.CS
package require ctrlutils::cufilter

::ctrlutils::cufilter::widget $path $listwidget   ;# build the filter box
::ctrlutils::cufilter::clear  $path               ;# empty it, show all
.CE
.IP \(bu
\fBwidget $path $listwidget\fR \-\- create a filter entry at \fB$path\fR, wired to \fB$listwidget\fR (a \fBtkufilelist\fR). Returns \fB$path\fR.
.IP \(bu
\fBclear $path\fR \-\- empty the box and return focus to the list.
.SS Filtering
.PP
The typed text becomes a glob passed to \fBtkufilelist::setFilter\fR: bare text is wrapped as \fB*text*\fR so it matches as a substring; text containing \fB*\fR or \fB?\fR is used as a full glob. Matching is case\-insensitive. Escape or the clear button empties the box.
.SS Wiring
.CS
::tkutils::tkufilelist::widget .list -dir [pwd]
::ctrlutils::cufilter::widget .filter .list
pack .filter -side top -fill x
pack .list   -side bottom -fill both -expand 1
.CE
.PP
Requires a \fBtkufilelist\fR with the \fB\-filter\fR option / \fBsetFilter\fR method.
.SS "See also"
.PP
\fBcufileops\fR, \fBcumonitor\fR, \fBcuundo\fR, \fBtkutils::tkufilelist\fR
